<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Global Marine raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Global Marine raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Global Marine Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 17-3/8.</p>
